      "value": "First of al it would be the stupidest thing to provide two Menus which one of has always been planed to replaced, not even talking about that maintaining the two would be a pain for the Developers.\nAnd what don't you like about it? Give some specific reasons about why you think is bad and tell us / me what you think they should change to make it better.\nJust saying you want the old one because you don't like the new UI is not really helpful. And please don't tell me you just don't like it because it's new and you don't know where stuff is. The new Quick Menu is organized wayyyy better then the old one.",
